      "writtenOn": "2023-04-04T20:18:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This comment is the only reason `chooseRenderer()` isn\u0027t called earlier. I had actually wanted to fix it up so that the Renderer was known before `applyClipToDraw()` was called so that we could account for the analytic AA outset in the draw bounds.\n\nWe should also have the Renderer chosen before we do the DstReadRequirement so that we know whether or not analytic AA or MSAA is being used, which will impact things. That should be a relatively easy CL to put together that I can try and do this week.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 931,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 933,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "db648177c1c766db7dc69e791ecc0e28e126a316",
