      "lineNbr": 460,
      "author": {
        "id": 13824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-25T13:57:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there any good way to account for coverage to determine the final blend type when calling PaintParams.toKey()? The paint params at this point are independent of render steps so I guess we don\u0027t know how coverage will affect blending, or whether we\u0027ll need the dst color?",
